<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<definitions xmlns="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/MODEL/"
             xmlns:dmndi="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/DMNDI/"
             xmlns:dc="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20181101/DC/"
             xmlns:di="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20181101/DI/"
             id="Definitions_PA-36.3-corporate-policy-entity-governance"
             name="PA 36.3 corporate policy entity governance"
             namespace="https://erpplans.local/dmn/PA-36.3-corporate-policy-entity-governance"
             exporter="erpplans generate-dmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <decision id="Decision_W1732_01" name="Authorization threshold — W1732">
    <description>Source: VS-36-corporate-governance/PA-36.3-corporate-policy-entity-governance.md · workflow W1732 · step row (authorization thresholds)
Verbatim: DOA tiers by value: (a) &lt; PHP 50K: Department Manager, (b) PHP 50K–200K: Department Head / VP, (c) PHP 200K–1M: C-Suite member, (d) PHP 1M–10M: CEO, (e) &gt; PHP 10M: Board approval, (f) dual signature for bank transactions &gt; PHP 500K | Corporate Secretary / CFO | Board | Annual approval</description>
    <decisionTable hitPolicy="U">
      <input id="Decision_W1732_01_In01" label="Amount (PHP)">
        <inputExpression id="Decision_W1732_01_InExpr01" typeRef="number">
          <text>Amount</text>
        </inputExpression>
      </input>
      <output id="Decision_W1732_01_Out01" label="Approver" name="Approver" typeRef="string"/>
      <rule id="Decision_W1732_01_Rule01">
        <inputEntry><text>&lt; 50000</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;Department Manager&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1732_01_Rule02">
        <inputEntry><text>[50000..200000]</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;Department Head&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1732_01_Rule03">
        <inputEntry><text>(200000..1000000]</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;C-Suite&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1732_01_Rule04">
        <inputEntry><text>(1000000..10000000]</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;CEO&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1732_01_Rule05">
        <inputEntry><text>&gt; 10000000</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;Board + CFO&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
    </decisionTable>
  </decision>
  <decision id="Decision_W1736_02" name="Authorization threshold — W1736">
    <description>Source: VS-36-corporate-governance/PA-36.3-corporate-policy-entity-governance.md · workflow W1736 · step row (authorization thresholds)
Note: 1 non-monetary tier(s) in the source list are excluded from this amount-based table.
The source states only escalating lower bounds (&gt; PHP A -&gt; role 1; &gt; PHP B -&gt; role 2, ...); interpreted as an approval ladder — each band runs from its threshold to the next tier&#x27;s threshold.
Verbatim: Board oversight: CSR activities and budget presented to Board annually; significant disaster response commitments (&gt; PHP 1M) approved by CEO; &gt; PHP 5M reported to Board | Corporate Secretary | Board | Annual</description>
    <decisionTable hitPolicy="U">
      <input id="Decision_W1736_02_In01" label="Amount (PHP)">
        <inputExpression id="Decision_W1736_02_InExpr01" typeRef="number">
          <text>Amount</text>
        </inputExpression>
      </input>
      <output id="Decision_W1736_02_Out01" label="Approver" name="Approver" typeRef="string"/>
      <rule id="Decision_W1736_02_Rule01">
        <inputEntry><text>(1000000..5000000]</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;CEO&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1736_02_Rule02">
        <inputEntry><text>&gt; 5000000</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;Board&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
    </decisionTable>
  </decision>
  <dmndi:DMNDI>
    <dmndi:DMNDiagram id="Diagram_1">
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="Decision_W1732_01_di" dmnElementRef="Decision_W1732_01">
        <dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="200" height="90"/>
      </dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="Decision_W1736_02_di" dmnElementRef="Decision_W1736_02">
        <dc:Bounds x="420" y="80" width="200" height="90"/>
      </dmndi:DMNShape>
    </dmndi:DMNDiagram>
  </dmndi:DMNDI>
</definitions>
